  "verdict": "BernieSanders +0.115 gain is WITHIN NOISE, not stable: per-seed removal-minus-baseline recall deltas are +0.115 (seed 42), -0.085 (seed 43), -0.025 (seed 44), mean +0.0017 std 0.1026, with the sign flipping across seeds. The baseline arm alone swings 0.245-0.335 across seeds (range 0.090), so a 0.115 single-seed delta is within the observed seed noise. Right-wing rate delta likewise flips sign (mean +0.0083, std 0.0929). IDF (mean delta -0.025, std 0.0218) and MariaZakharova (mean delta -0.0417, std 0.0401) show small negative deltas stable in sign in 2-3 of 3 seeds but within ~1 std of zero. Conclusion: removing 202/16510 rows has no demonstrated systematic effect on unseen-author sbert_only recall; the single-seed Bernie gain does not replicate."
